[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 9784.59, "timestamp": "02:43:04", "text": "。所以，請前往法國科技樹。  你可以把它展示給你的觀眾。另外，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9790.389, "timestamp": "02:43:10", "text": "我無法即時查看，所以也無法即時指導你。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9795.19, "timestamp": "02:43:15", "text": "好了，朋友們。  研究。  研究。向下滾動，在最底部你會看到紅色的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9803.75, "timestamp": "02:43:23", "text": "拉斐爾。  是的。拉斐爾。  點擊那裡"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9806.87, "timestamp": "02:43:26", "text": "。點擊預覽。  預覽。這個。是的。  這是最新型的高科技噴射機，目前仍是全新的，並在包括印度空軍在內的許多國家的空軍中服役。它已在印度、法國、卡達以及我相信還有埃及的航空公司投入使用"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 9807.66, "timestamp": "02:43:27", "author": "@BRUCELEE-wt7hk", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/ytc/AIdro_kywKa6HSckNVxhER8qedLRRVkcGIqFFytjQHe-071HyMo=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "hello joqnix"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9819.429, "timestamp": "02:43:39", "text": "。我不確定埃及"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9824.15, "timestamp": "02:43:44", "text": "空軍是否在使用它，但現在至少有四、五個國家的空軍在使用它"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9826.79, "timestamp": "02:43:46", "text": "。這就是目前的技術水準"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 9833.177, "timestamp": "02:43:53", "author": "@BRUCELEE-wt7hk", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/ytc/AIdro_kywKa6HSckNVxhER8qedLRRVkcGIqFFytjQHe-071HyMo=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "how you doing"}]